sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant BR as Browser
  participant MW as Next.js Middleware
  participant AUTH as Supabase Auth
  participant DB as Postgres (RLS)

  U->>BR: Login dengan email dan password
  BR->>AUTH: signInWithPassword()
  AUTH-->>BR: access_token (JWT) dan refresh_token (cookie)

  U->>BR: Buka halaman terproteksi
  BR->>MW: HTTP request plus cookie sesi
  MW->>AUTH: auth.getUser() validasi token
  alt Token valid
    AUTH-->>MW: user tervalidasi, refresh token bila perlu
    MW-->>BR: lanjutkan request, set-cookie token baru
  else Token tidak ada / kadaluarsa
    AUTH-->>MW: user = null
    MW-->>BR: redirect ke /login
  end

  BR->>DB: query data, misal supabase.from("stock_items")
  DB->>DB: RLS memeriksa auth.uid() dari klaim JWT
  DB-->>BR: hanya baris data milik user tersebut
